.idea
tmp
/dist
/release
# Release zips served from Admin > System > Release Downloads: /releases is the local
# docker-compose default for RELEASES_HOST_DIR (Docker creates it root-owned on first up),
# /server/releases is the dev/jest fallback of resolveReleasesDir().
/releases/
/server/releases/
/node_modules/
/client/.ai_work_dir/
/test-results/
/docs/perftests/
/server/perf-tests/dist/
server/perf-tests/*.js
.claude/settings.local.json
*.stackdump
.vite/
.mcp.json.tmp
/server/logs/
/logs/
# Repo export/import zips: the dev/jest fallback of resolveExportImportStagingDir() (EXPORT_IMPORT_DIR unset).
/server/export-import/
# Local dev postgres cluster (bind-mounted by server/artisyn-log-run-local/docker-compose.yml).
/server/artisyn-log-run-local/data/
# Shared Claude profile of the dev sandboxes (login, history), mounted into every container
# by scripts/claude-docker.mjs as CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR.
/docker-dev/claude-home/
# Claude sandbox worktrees (scripts/claude-docker.mjs)
/.worktrees/
/Claude.local.md
/.playwright-work-folder/
.playwright-work-folder/
/artisyn-hooks-installer/node_modules/
artisyn-hooks-installer/node_modules/
artisyn-hooks-installer/dist/
server/src/public/static/*.tgz
server/src/public/static/*.tar.gz
# Written by build-hooks-installer.js and on every backend start (a fresh sandbox worktree has no
# local ignore file for it).
server/src/public/static/installer-version.json
/artisyn-hooks-installer/dist/

# E2E run scratch — never commit (storageState carries session cookies;
# lock dir + run-id are per-run only).
/tests/e2e/.auth/
/tests/e2e/.e2e-run.lock/
/tests/e2e/.e2e-run-id

# Session corpus sets: recorded locally by `npm run corpus:bootstrap` (claude -p), never committed
# (tests/corpus/README.md). The scenarios, known-format.json and the README stay tracked.
/tests/corpus/sets/

# Local Azure SSO reference data — real client secrets, never commit.
/docs/login-sso-data/

# Personal skill: writes/reads task open-questions docs in Russian (open-questions-ru skill).
# Neither the skill itself nor the files it produces are shared with the team.
/.claude/skills/open-questions-ru/
**/open_questions_ru.md

# Claude Code runtime state (per machine, never committed)
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
**/.claude/scheduled_tasks.json
**/.claude/routines/.state/
**/.claude/worktrees/
**/.claude/checkpoints/
**/.claude/mailbox/
**/.claude/agent-registry.json
**/.claude/agent-memory-local
**/.claude/first-run
**/.claude/assistant-daemon-state.json
/CLAUDE.local.md
